; The opam contract: the depends list in dune-project must cover every library
; the workspace's dune files name, the opam file dune generates from it must
; name the same packages, and the jasmin constraint must hold for the release
; vendor/jasmin.lock pins. test_opam_contract.ml says what each case proves.
;
; The test reads the tree from the root the stanza hands it, so the stanza
; depends on the whole source tree: a dune file that gains a library must make
; this test run again, and naming the files one by one would let a new one
; slip past unnoticed.

(test
 (name test_opam_contract)
 (deps
  (source_tree ../..))
 (action
  (run %{test} %{workspace_root})))
